== Effect ==
* Upon use, a friendly {{E|Monstro}} jumps on a random enemy, dealing 120 damage while destroying nearby [[obstacles]] like rocks.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r}} This item can be spawned by {{e|Bumbino}} if he picks up 12 cents.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r+}} This item has a 1% chance to drop when defeating {{e|Monstro}}.{{dlc-}}
* This item will target Isaac if it is used in a [[room]] without monsters and can cause damage (a full heart).
** Monstro can be dodged depending on Isaac's [[Speed]] and his movement.
** Monstro can open {{R|Secret Room}}s or destroy [[tinted rock]]s without hurting Isaac, if timed correctly.
* Monstro will target {{e|Shopkeeper}}s. 
* {{Dlc|nr}} Like {{e|Mom}} and {{E|Satan}}'s stomp attacks, this attack is treated as an explosion, so {{i|Pyromaniac}} and {{i|Host Hat}} will be activated if Monstro falls on Isaac.
* {{dlc|na}} This item does not affect the {{E|Monstro}} boss.

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns wisps in the middle ring, looking like teeth. These wisps shoot 50% slower than the average wisp, but deal 12 damage per shot.}}
* {{i|Car Battery}}: Monstro deals double damage.

